NOTICE
======

What this is
------------

`palimpsest-ouroboros` is a single artifact that rewrites itself twice a day. A
program reads the banner it wrote last time, fades every line already on it, drops
what has faded past reading, and writes one new line on top. Nothing is ever
erased; the old lines are still in the file, going quiet. A second program cuts an
engraved ouroboros from the same state. Both are drawn entirely from the
repository's own commit history, and from nothing else — no clock, no randomness,
no input from outside.

The work is the whole of it: the drawings, the programs that make them, the ledger
that records each generation, and the writing around them.

